<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,248,243)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="34" width="500" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>03  我们的价值</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="54" width="720" height="36"><content textType="body" fontSize="23" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.1" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>能力三 · 训练层：先判任务需要什么能力，再决定怎么训</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="96" width="36" height="3"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="92" topLeftY="97" width="814" height="1"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(220,224,228)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="516" width="420" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>Nivis · 基于大语言模型的代码安全分析系统</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="840" topLeftY="516" width="66" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="right" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>13 / 30</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="118" width="380" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>方法 · 我们会什么</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="148" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>01</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="149" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>任务-能力匹配分析</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="168" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>格式遵循靠 SFT、知识靠 RAG 检索、判别靠证据约束、偏好靠 DPO/GRPO——不迷信“继续训练解决一切”。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="222" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>02</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="223" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>分得清能训什么、不能硬训什么</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="242" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>CPT 知识注入两次“训练成功、评估爆炸”，判定为知识负迁移后果断放弃，不沉没成本。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="296" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>03</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="297" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>为泛化设计数据</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="316" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>同一弱点造改名 / 换控制流 / 换框架写法的多变体，防止模型背下训练题。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="370" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>04</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="371" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>单变量控制</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="390" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>每轮只动一个变量，效果才可归因、失败才可定位，多个变量一起动等于没做实验。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(52,94,128)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="508" topLeftY="118" width="400" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对 · 这些方法解决过什么</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(52,94,128)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="158" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>零样本 → SFT：什么真的涨了</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="180" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>qwen3-8b 零样本 CVE-fix 召回 0.375，SFT 后 α0.5 到 0.850——格式与判别确实可训。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(52,94,128)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="258" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>strict/micro 不涨 → 归给架构</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="280" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>继续训练不涨严格归因，判断是架构问题而非模型问题，由两阶段与信任层补齐。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(52,94,128)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="358" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>偏好优化失败 → 双轨策略</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="380" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>三次失败后划清 16GB 硬件边界：本地验证方法、云端放大；双教师蒸馏约百元建成万条语料。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="852" height="58" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(31,46,56)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="4" height="58" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="458" width="400" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>CORE PRINCIPLE</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="475" width="812" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>知道“不训什么”和知道“训什么”同样重要——训练不是堆参数，是匹配任务与能力。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>第三层是训练能力。动手前先做任务-能力匹配：格式遵循可以 SFT，知识用 RAG 注入而不是继续预训练，判别靠证据约束，偏好用 DPO、GRPO。我们两次尝试 CPT 知识注入，训练指标好看、评估直接爆炸，判断是负迁移后果断放弃。数据为泛化而造，同一弱点做多变体；每轮只动一个变量。右边是真实曲线：零样本 0.375，SFT 后 0.850，证明格式和判别可训；但严格归因不涨，我们没有继续堆训练，而是判断这是架构问题交给两阶段解决。α0.6 的 10167 条语料已经冻结，等待开训。</p></content></note></slide>